  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1162/406/curseforgebannersna1-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"45\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1162/598/enought_guns_curseforge-page-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"595\" height=\"104\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@BalModsSaga\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1161/953/curseforge_youtubebutton-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"206\" height=\"46\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/Gbe3zj76Nq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1161/951/curseforge_discordbutton-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"266\" height=\"51\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbalmods-saga.odoo.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1161/952/curseforge_websitebutton-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"206\" height=\"46\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>在你的冒險中加入簡易武器</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>武器種類從突擊步槍到簡易手槍和泵動式霰彈槍應有盡有。每種武器都使用專屬的彈藥，且所有彈藥皆可自行製作。</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>武器主要以鐵製成，能夠進行遠程攻擊，根據所使用的武器，造成的傷害會有高低之分。</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1162/597/enought_guns_curseforge_imagena2-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"725\" height=\"408\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1162/407/curseforgebannersna2-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1279\" height=\"45\"></p>",
